<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Raytheon cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Raytheon cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said on Monday it cut its rating on Raytheon Co from its prior rating of buy to a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- Raytheon shares lost 1/4 to 48-5/8 in early trading.</p>
</text>
